{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01SLABz5zrkg4aW3AQCPYZWZ", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olestra\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.mentalfloss.com/food/olestra-fat-free-snack-controversy-1990s\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.mentalfloss.com/article/619261/olestra-fat-free-snack-controversy-1990s\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.hoover.org/node/39757\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wikipedia.com/wiki/Olestra\"}, {\"url\": \"https://agris.fao.org/search/ar/records/65df424b0f3e94b9e5d6b3f3\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2003-08-05/pdf/03-19508.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://cei.org/?p=62330\"}, {\"url\": \"https://las.touro.edu/media/schools-and-colleges/lander-college-for-arts-and-sciences/biology/publications/fall-2011/fda_safety_of_olestra_lebel.pdf\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:06:13.623Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "FDA approval olestra savory snacks year", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01LkT4QimsRt7He4rMrB56XH", "content": [{"title": "Olestra", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olestra"}, {"title": "olestra fat free snack controversy 1990s", "url": "https://www.mentalfloss.com/food/olestra-fat-free-snack-controversy-1990s"}, {"title": "olestra fat free snack controversy 1990s", "url": "https://www.mentalfloss.com/article/619261/olestra-fat-free-snack-controversy-1990s"}, {"title": "- Law & Policy", "url": "https://www.hoover.org/node/39757"}, {"title": "www.wikipedia.com", "url": "https://www.wikipedia.com/wiki/Olestra"}, {"title": "Olestra: a new food additive", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/ar/records/65df424b0f3e94b9e5d6b3f3"}, {"title": "www.govinfo.gov", "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2003-08-05/pdf/03-19508.pdf"}, {"title": "FDA Fails to Give Olestra Fair Weight: Henry Miller LA Times Op-Ed", "url": "https://cei.org/?p=62330"}, {"title": "fda safety of olestra lebel", "url": "https://las.touro.edu/media/schools-and-colleges/lander-college-for-arts-and-sciences/biology/publications/fall-2011/fda_safety_of_olestra_lebel.pdf"}]}, "The FDA approved olestra for savory snacks in 1996. The agency decided on January 25, 1996 that olestra was safe for uses such as potato and corn chips, after the petitioner narrowed its request to that category. In 1987, Procter and Gamble petitioned the FDA to allow olestra as a replacement for conventional fats. The petitioner later restricted its request for use in savory snacks. The FDA concluded on January 25, 1996, that olestra was safe for savory snacks. The Federal Register notice of the approval appeared on January 30, 1996.\n\nThe approval came with conditions. The agency required vitamins to be added to offset losses of fat-soluble vitamins, and it required a warning label about gastrointestinal effects. In 2003, the FDA eliminated the warning label requirement, saying it \"was no longer warranted\" because post-market studies showed only infrequent, mild gastrointestinal effects.\n\nOlestra's commercial life was short. It lost popularity in the late 2000s over supposed side effects and is largely phased out. The Wikipedia claim that no olestra products were sold in the US as of 2023 is marked \"citation needed,\" so treat it as unverified."], "durationSeconds": 8.493065416, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01SLABz5zrkg4aW3AQCPYZWZ", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDYCvHa65QP2NNVCEWaG", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案:1996 年。**\n\nFDA 于 1996 年 1 月 25 日裁定 olestra 可用于咸味零食,比如薯片和玉米片。宝洁(Procter & Gamble)1987 年提出申请,后来把申请范围缩小到咸味零食。批准有附带条件:要补充脂溶性维生素,并且要加肠胃不适的警告标签。2003 年 FDA 取消了警告标签的要求。\n\n我只搜了 1 次。上面的内容来自搜索结果的摘要,我没有打开这些页面逐一核对。\n\nSources:\n- [Olestra – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olestra)\n- [Mental Floss:olestra 与 90 年代的无脂零食争议](https://www.mentalfloss.com/food/olestra-fat-free-snack-controversy-1990s)\n- [Federal Register, 2003-08-05(取消警告标签)](https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2003-08-05/pdf/03-19508.pdf)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1057, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4297, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1057}, "output_tokens": 369, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:06:18.233Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDYCv2h3hnaqBXMHSVSc"}
